   "text": "keep it just the two of us?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 2.36,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "birthday_party.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You could do both. Brunch for two, then a small get together with friends in the evening.",
